WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.750
- Amandla. I heard you
were thankful to have,

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.847
this is awesome, bathroom
breaks on this set.

00:00:05.847 --> 00:00:08.170
So was there a set you were on that

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.630
You didn't have bathroom
breaks? Who should we call?

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.750
- Okay. Yeah,

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.700
I think the origin of this
particular motif is when

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.180
I have the immense privilege
and honor to be on the set of

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.560
Lemonade.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.170
And we were in trees a lot.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.111
That was like a huge theme of it.

00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:29.530
And Mains and Daya were placed
up in this like really high

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.780
tree that we had to be
basically like lifted up into.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.410
And we were up there for hours and hours

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.500
and we really had to pee,

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.833
but we didn't want to like
stop Beyonce production,

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.740
Asking to be lifted down from the trees.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.460
So we ended up just being there like,

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.830
holding it the whole time
and being like, Beyoncé?

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.040
- What a cool project that
would be a part of as well.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.860
That's so cool. Can y'all
relate to anything like that?

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.560
If you were ever on like a
set and you were like, God,

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.120
I really gotta go to the bathroom,

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.890
but like I can't right now?

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:05.230
- I was at the Oscars and it was the,

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.480
it was the year, it was 2015.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.680
It was when I was wearing
this really kind of

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:10.964
tight Chanel dress,

00:01:10.964 --> 00:01:13.250
and, I was nominated for best actress.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.750
And we were halfway through the show

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.276
and the show lasts a really long time.

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:18.480
- They're not letting it go.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.540
They're not letting it pass over.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.230
- But anyway, it lasts like
hours and hours and hours.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.350
So halfway through, finally
my husband and I got up

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.183
and I said,

00:01:25.183 --> 00:01:26.480
I'm just gonna have a
glass of wine really fast.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:29.690
And I knocked it back. I
was so nervous and I'm like,

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.940
I'm gonna go now, I'm
gonna go to the bathroom.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.790
And I got in there and I was like, I,

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.000
I can't get my dress off.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.729
I can't get it up. I can't get it down.

00:01:38.729 --> 00:01:42.360
I can't do anything. So I
just walked down and I said,

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.644
well, I'm gonna have to
hold it all the time.

00:01:44.644 --> 00:01:45.590
- What?

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.570
- Yeah. Yeah. So yeah,

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:49.020
it wasn't until the very end
after I'd done all the press

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.160
and everything that I finally
went to the bathroom with my

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.520
manager and we took my dress off.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:53.870
- Just so you know

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:57.920
I am totally not above like
knocking on the next toilet

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.580
be like, Hey, I don't know you,

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.610
but can you undress me so I can pee?

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:04.260
And then I would, and just so y'all know

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.310
if you're ever in a bathroom
with me I'm gonna ask

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:10.593
We need another quick break
and we'll cut that out.

